1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,400
Meet AMMA: the Armenian Mining
and Metallurgy Association.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,700
Armenia's mining story spans centuries.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:11,700
The Akhtala copper mines were
first recorded in the 13th century.

4
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,000
Then came Alaverdi in the 1770s,

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,900
Kapan in the 1840s,

6
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:17,800
Kajaran in the 1950s,

7
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,600
and Agarak in 1963.

8
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:25,300
Armenia lies on the Tethyan belt, one of
the world's major copper–gold provinces.

9
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:31,600
Eight metallic deposits are in operation, and
mining is about 30–35% of merchandise exports.

10
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,400
Since 2006, AMMA has been the
unifying link of the industry.

11
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:41,200
Its 42 member organisations span mining,
metallurgy, services, science and education,

12
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:45,600
including every metal mining
company operating in Armenia.

13
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:50,300
From 2024 to 2026, AMMA took the
sector's voice to government:

14
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:52,800
at the Prime Minister's workshops,

15
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:56,600
in a standing working
group with the ministry,

16
00:00:56,700 --> 00:01:01,700
and with proposals on subsoil and land rights,
waste, and environmental impact assessment.

17
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:08,300
In May 2026, AMMA became an association member of
ICMM, the International Council on Mining and Metals.

18
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:12,600
Its partners include Eurometaux and
the Mining Association of Canada,

19
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:16,700
and it represents Armenia at
events from London to Lima.

20
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:22,600
On standards, AMMA completed TSM preparatory
work with the Mining Association of Canada,

21
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:26,400
and is now working towards
national adoption of CMSI.

22
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:32,600
It also champions the move from the Soviet reserve
classification to CRIRSCO-aligned reporting.

23
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:38,400
On 16–17 October, the third Mining
Armenia Forum meets in Tsaghkadzor,

24
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:43,600
expecting over 300 participants
from more than 20 countries.

25
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:47,300
AMMA is also building the next
generation's capabilities,

26
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:51,700
with Yerevan State University and the
National Polytechnic University of Armenia.

27
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:55,400
AMMA: a single window to
Armenia's mining sector.

28
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:58,400
Learn more at armmining.am.
